WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:04.910
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and JJ Abrams
just officially announced the Star Wars Episode

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:10.969
VII Cast so I wanted to do a full breakdown
as well as address what’s going on with

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:17.660
the story and how they’re basically skipping
over all the expanded universe material.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.650
Since we have a cast now too it will be a
lot easier to do bonus videos so be sure to

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.560
leave me suggestions for anything Star Wars
you guys want to talk about and I’ll start

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:26.560
doing more.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:27.560
If you’re finding me for the first time
be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:33.160
I’ll try to dedicate on day during the week
as a Star Wars day going forward.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:37.460
So let’s start with the big stuff.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:38.460
Cast breakdown.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:41.390
These are just the main cast members, there’s
going to be an army of creatures and extras

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.920
that we’ll find out about eventually.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.150
But starting at the top.

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:49.370
The trinity, Mark Hamill, Carrie Fisher and
Harrison Ford.

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:52.809
We kind of already knew about them, but there
were a lot of rumors as to how they would

00:00:52.809 --> 00:00:54.440
be part of the story.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:56.920
Essentially they’re going to be themselves,
they’re not going to be holo recordings.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:01.570
JJ Abrams actually released a picture of a
script read through they all did yesterday.

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:04.559
We can talk about the script in a second.

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:08.610
But we have old Luke, Old Leia and Old Han.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:13.940
Then There’s Peter Mayhew, Anthony Daniels
and Kenny Baker in their original roles.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:16.170
It’s not a party without the originals.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:21.690
The big news is really the new characters,
and even though we know the cast.

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:23.430
We don’t know who they’re playing yet.

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:27.810
So I’ll talk more about characters in a
future bonus video.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:32.479
But we’ve got Andy Serkis, who’s probably
playing a creature, hopefully a dark jedi

00:01:32.479 --> 00:01:34.720
creature.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:41.500
Domhnall Gleeson he was Bill Weasley in the
Harry Potter movies, Adam Driver who you can

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:46.190
see on HBO’s Girls, Oscar Isaac who has
done a bunch of small stuff but you probably

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:51.970
heard about him after Inside Llewyn Davis,
Max von Sydow, there’s no way he’s not

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:53.350
playing a villain.

00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:58.560
John Boyega who was in Attack of The Block,
which was an awesome movie you have to watch.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.860
and Daisy Ridley who’s kind of an unknown.

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:05.810
I’d be willing to bet that Gleeson, Boyega
and Ridley are also jedi characters.

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:10.000
Essentially the big teaser is Skywalker children,
from Luke and Leia.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.880
But here’s where we need to talk about the
story.

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:15.030
It’s not going to look like anything we’ve
seen in the expanded universe.

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:21.599
Star Wars made a big announcement last week
that essentially said in order to allow maximum

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:24.950
creative freedom to the writers of the new
movies.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:31.150
They would not be including and expanded universe
canon.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.849
So bad new good news.

00:02:32.849 --> 00:02:36.420
Bad news is, there’s a massive roster of
characters that will not be used like Mara

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.900
Jade and Star Killer.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:39.250
They’re not getting rid of the Expanded
Universe.

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:40.690
But it will just exist by itself off to the
side.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:42.180
Think of it as like alternate universe stories.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:45.610
The Good News is mostly that Chewie is dead.

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:49.210
And they have the opportunity to side step
any previous issues with stories that didn’t

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.910
pan out or were unsuccessful.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.709
So if there was something you didn’t like
from the expanded universe.

00:02:54.709 --> 00:02:57.930
You don’t have to worry about it.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:03.860
I think one of my future bonus videos will
be about all my favorite Expanded Universe

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:04.860
stories.

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.019
There are a lot of good ones.

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:10.379
Timothy Zahn’s Heir to The Empire trilogy
essentially re-ignited my passion for Star

00:03:10.379 --> 00:03:15.090
Wars in the 90s, when all they were doing
was re-releasing VHS tapes every two years.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:18.460
So let’s have a moment for all those novel
and comic book characters that just cried

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:19.460
out.

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:20.460
Disney’s Death Star just silenced them.

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:22.290
So what’s going on with filming right now?

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:24.830
They’ve actually been shooting for a few
months.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:27.590
Nothing with main cast members, mostly just
B-Roll and second unit stuff.

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:30.250
Things that don’t require actors to speak.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:33.489
It’s really funny the way big movies like
this get made.

00:03:33.489 --> 00:03:38.409
Did you know they start shooting actual scenes
with characters before the script is finished.

00:03:38.409 --> 00:03:40.780
It’s just so that they can hit their release
date.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:44.239
It used to take almost 3 or 4 years to make
a movie this big.

00:03:44.239 --> 00:03:48.400
But now because they compartmentalize everything,
they can get them out in 2 years.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:54.200
No one officially knows what the story is,
but we did see a picture of an AT-AT foot

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.459
on Tatooine.

00:03:55.459 --> 00:03:59.760
We also know a few facts, here they are in
no particular order:

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:04.920
The new Trilogy will exist inside the George
Lucas chronology, the holy trinity will be

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:08.489
in their 60s, pretty close to their real-life
age.

00:04:08.489 --> 00:04:12.090
Harrison Ford is way older than Mark Hamill,
but you get the idea.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:16.280
Because Luke was in his mid-twenties during
Return of The Jedi, we can assume that Episode

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:20.359
VII will pick up about 40 years after the
events of the original trilogy.

00:04:20.359 --> 00:04:23.100
Not including flashbacks or visions of the
future.

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:27.849
We will see most of the major planets featured
in the Lucas trilogy, including Coruscant,

00:04:27.849 --> 00:04:29.370
Tatooine and Yavin.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:32.059
They will be sticking to George Lucas Canon.

00:04:32.059 --> 00:04:33.619
Which means the Sith rule of two.

00:04:33.619 --> 00:04:38.099
and, Disney has already commissioned new novels
that are being written inside the new storyline

00:04:38.099 --> 00:04:39.699
the movies will draw from.

00:04:39.699 --> 00:04:44.680
The novels will fill some of the time gaps
between episode 6 and 7.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.689
Three of them are being released this fall
starting in November.

00:04:47.689 --> 00:04:52.629
The first one is about Grand Moff Tarkin,
the second is called Droids in Distress and

00:04:52.629 --> 00:04:57.119
ties in with the Rebels cartoon that’s debuting
in the fall and the third one is also a Rebels

00:04:57.119 --> 00:04:59.189
cartoon tie in called the Inquisitor’s Trap.

00:04:59.189 --> 00:05:03.370
I’ll be doing weekly videos for Rebels when
it starts airing.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:04.629
That’s going to be around October.

00:05:04.629 --> 00:05:07.389
That series will pick up 5 years before the
battle of Yavin.

00:05:07.389 --> 00:05:12.789
So I’m going to be doing tons of Star Wars
stuff this year, I’m super excited.

00:05:12.789 --> 00:05:18.830
So be sure to subscribe to get everything
and leave me suggestions for bonus videos.

