I’ll try to announce which day will be my
dedicated Star Wars Day going forward.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:24.789
Maybe Monday mornings.

00:05:24.789 --> 00:05:28.960
or Tuesday’s when agents of shield goes
away.

